# Live: explore browser with real synced catalog (skills)

Output out/05-explore-browser.mp4
Output out/05-explore-browser.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Padding 10
Set Margin 0
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "./bin/run-spur-tui-live.sh"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@25s /Lineage/
Sleep 800ms
Hide
Ctrl+K
Show
Wait+Screen@15s /Go to/
Hide
Type "Explore"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@20s /synced/
Sleep 3s
